title|*Bouncing Ball
scale|0.07
loop|forever

## A single ball hops across the display: each 4-tube hop arcs floor -> middle ->
## top -> middle -> floor, four bounces over the 16 tubes (wraps seamlessly).
## The ball is one horizontal blip whose height is the lit row; on the floor it
## flattens to the underline, reading as a little squash on impact.
sprite|bl_top|0x0001 ## apex   (top horizontal)
sprite|bl_mid|0x2200 ## middle (mid-bars)
sprite|bl_gnd|0x4000 ## floor  (underline -- squashed)

frame|1|{bl_gnd} {14}
frame|1| {bl_mid} {13}
frame|1| {1}{bl_top} {12}
frame|1| {2}{bl_mid} {11}
frame|1| {3}{bl_gnd} {10}
frame|1| {4}{bl_mid} {9}
frame|1| {5}{bl_top} {8}
frame|1| {6}{bl_mid} {7}
frame|1| {7}{bl_gnd} {6}
frame|1| {8}{bl_mid} {5}
frame|1| {9}{bl_top} {4}
frame|1| {10}{bl_mid} {3}
frame|1| {11}{bl_gnd} {2}
frame|1| {12}{bl_mid} {1}
frame|1| {13}{bl_top} 
frame|1| {14}{bl_mid}
